WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Sales → Weekly report and select the location and Monday–Sunday week.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.458
Step 2: Enter Till sales, Cash, Eftpos, Petty cash, Uber Eats and DoorDash. Arrow keys and Enter move between entry fields.

3
00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:19.458
Step 3: Record actual zeroes for unused channels; leave unknown amounts blank.

4
00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:25.458
Step 4: Review the expense views and platform fee tables, then press Save weekly report.

5
00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:31.458
Step 5: Use Overview to compare saved weekly sales, cost percentages and profit.
